---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Edge telemetry" description="Live probes against this site: enumeration and secret-hunting requests seen at the CloudFront edge, mapped to MITRE ATT&CK, plus what the contact form's honeypot and API defenses blocked." active="edge">
  <div class="wrap page edge-page" data-edge>
    <p class="eyebrow">Edge telemetry</p>
    <h1>Who’s knocking: live probes against this site</h1>
    <p class="lead muted">
      Every public site gets scanned. This page summarizes the last 24 hours of requests at the CloudFront edge
      that went looking for secrets, source code, backups or admin panels, maps each pattern to a MITRE ATT&amp;CK
      technique, and shows what the site answered. It also counts what the contact form’s honeypot and API
      defenses turned away. It refreshes daily.
    </p>

    <section class="strip card" aria-label="Summary">
      <dl class="stats" data-edge-stats>
        <div><dt>Last updated</dt><dd data-k="updated">…</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Requests (24h)</dt><dd data-k="requests">…</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Probes (24h)</dt><dd data-k="probes">…</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Probe share</dt><dd data-k="share">…</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="leak mono" data-edge-leak role="status">Loading the latest report…</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="techniques-h">
      <h2 id="techniques-h">ATT&amp;CK techniques observed</h2>
      <p class="muted small">Mapped from what each request tried to reach. The mapping shows intent, not success.</p>
      <div class="techniques" data-edge-techniques></div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="trend-h">
      <h2 id="trend-h">ATT&amp;CK techniques over 30 days</h2>
      <p class="muted small">Probes per day for each technique category, busiest first. Hover a day for its count.</p>
      <div class="card trend" data-edge-trend></div>
    </section>

    <div class="cols">
      <section class="card" aria-labelledby="paths-h">
        <h2 id="paths-h">Top probed paths</h2>
        <ol class="paths mono" data-edge-paths></ol>
      </section>
      <section class="card" aria-labelledby="families-h">
        <h2 id="families-h">Scanner families</h2>
        <ul class="bars" data-edge-families></ul>
      </section>
      <section class="card" aria-labelledby="countries-h">
        <h2 id="countries-h">Countries</h2>
        <ul class="bars" data-edge-countries></ul>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="contact-defenses" aria-labelledby="contact-h" data-contact-section hidden>
      <h2 id="contact-h">Contact form defenses (30 days)</h2>
      <p class="muted small">
        Bots that find the form are stopped before anything reaches an inbox. These are counts only: no names,
        addresses or message text are logged, and real messages aren’t counted here.
      </p>
      <dl class="card defenses">
        <div><dt>Honeypot catches</dt><dd data-c="honeypot">—</dd><dd class="why">Filled in the hidden field humans never see. Got a fake “sent”.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Direct-API bypass</dt><dd data-c="bypass">—</dd><dd class="why">Called the API directly without the CDN’s secret header. 403.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Cross-site posts</dt><dd data-c="cross_origin">—</dd><dd class="why">Posted from another website’s origin. 403.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Throttled</dt><dd data-c="throttled">—</dd><dd class="why">Exceeded the API’s rate limit. 429.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Rejected input</dt><dd data-c="invalid">—</dd><dd class="why">Missing fields, bad email, oversized or malformed body. 400.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Wrong route or method</dt><dd data-c="wrong_route">—</dd><dd class="why">Requests to <code>/api/*</code> that aren’t a contact POST. 404.</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <div class="cols two">
        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="contact-trend-h">
          <h2 id="contact-trend-h">Blocked per day</h2>
          <div class="trend contact-trend" data-contact-trend></div>
        </section>
        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="reasons-h">
          <h2 id="reasons-h">Why input was rejected</h2>
          <ul class="bars" data-contact-reasons></ul>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card how" aria-labelledby="how-h">
      <h2 id="how-h">How this works</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>CloudFront delivers access logs to CloudWatch Logs. Cookies and forwarded-for headers are never recorded. Viewer IP addresses are kept for 7 days for investigating abuse, are never published here, and the private admin view shows them only as network prefixes.</li>
        <li>Once a day a Lambda function runs a Logs Insights query, sorts requests into categories from a versioned pattern file, and publishes a summary to this site.</li>
        <li>Only paths that matched a probe pattern are shown, shortened, with emails redacted and unsafe characters encoded. Query strings are never published.</li>
        <li>Contact form counts come from the form handler’s outcome logs (honeypot, rejected, invalid) and the edge logs for <code>/api/*</code> (throttled, wrong route). Deploy smoke tests and real messages are left out.</li>
        <li>Anyone can send requests, so counts are what the edge observed, not verified attacks.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="muted small">See <a href="/architecture/">how this site is hosted and secured</a>. In the terminal (press <kbd>`</kbd>), run <code>edge</code>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<script>
  import { initEdge } from '../scripts/edge';
  initEdge();
</script>

<style is:global>
  .edge-page { padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 32px; }
  .edge-page .lead { max-width: 72ch; font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .edge-page section { margin-top: 28px; }
  .edge-page h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .edge-page .small { font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .edge-page .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin: 0; }
  @media (min-width: 760px) { .edge-page .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
  .edge-page .stats dt { font: 500 0.72rem var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .edge-page .stats dd { margin: 2px 0 0; font: 700 1.25rem var(--mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .edge-page .leak { margin: 14px 0 0; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .edge-page .leak[data-state='ok'] { color: var(--ok); border-color: var(--ok); }
  .edge-page .leak[data-state='alert'] { color: var(--danger); border-color: var(--danger); }
  .edge-page .leak[data-state='warn'] { color: var(--warn); border-color: var(--warn); }
  .edge-page .techniques { display: grid; gap: 14px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  @media (min-width: 760px) { .edge-page .techniques { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  .edge-page .tech { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
  .edge-page .tech[data-zero] { opacity: 0.55; }
  .edge-page .tech header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; }
  .edge-page .tech h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; }
  .edge-page .tech .count { font: 800 1.4rem var(--mono); color: var(--accent); }
  .edge-page .tactic { font: 500 0.72rem var(--mono); color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
  .edge-page .ids { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
  .edge-page .ids a { font: 600 0.8rem var(--mono); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; text-decoration: none; }
  .edge-page .codes { font: 0.8rem var(--mono); color: var(--text-muted); }
  .edge-page .codes .bad { color: var(--danger); font-weight: 700; }
  .edge-page .trend > svg, .edge-page .contact-trend svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  .edge-page .heat { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  .edge-page .heat-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 4px 12px; align-items: center; }
  .edge-page .heat-row .heat-label { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .edge-page .heat-row { grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 250px) minmax(0, 1fr) 56px; }
    .edge-page .heat-row .heat-label { grid-column: auto; }
  }
  .edge-page .heat-label { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 2px 8px; align-items: baseline; min-width: 0; }
  .edge-page .heat-name { font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .edge-page .heat-ids { font: 0.72rem var(--mono); color: var(--text-muted); }
  .edge-page .heat-strip { width: 100%; height: 18px; display: block; }
  .edge-page .heat-total { font: 700 0.9rem var(--mono); text-align: right; }
  .edge-page .heat-row.zero .heat-name, .edge-page .heat-row.zero .heat-total { color: var(--text-muted); }
  .edge-page .heat-axis .axis-row { margin: 0; }
  .edge-page .heat-axis .heat-total { font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  @media (max-width: 759px) { .edge-page .heat-axis .heat-label { display: none; } }
  /* Sequential, one hue (the accent): no probes = sunken track, then four steps of increasing strength. */
  .edge-page .l0 { fill: var(--bg-sunken); stroke: var(--line-strong); stroke-width: 1; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }
  .edge-page .l1 { fill: var(--accent); fill-opacity: 0.3; }
  .edge-page .l2 { fill: var(--accent); fill-opacity: 0.55; }
  .edge-page .l3 { fill: var(--accent); fill-opacity: 0.8; }
  .edge-page .l4 { fill: var(--accent-strong); }
  .edge-page .nodata { fill: var(--line); fill-opacity: 0.45; }
  .edge-page .heat-legend { flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
  .edge-page .heat-legend > span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px; }
  .edge-page .heat-key { width: 10px; height: 14px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; }
  .edge-page .heat-note { margin: 6px 0 0; }
  .edge-page .axis-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin: 6px 0 0; font: 0.75rem var(--mono); color: var(--text-muted); }
  .edge-page .legend-row { display: flex; gap: 16px; font: 0.8rem var(--mono); color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px; }
  .edge-page .swatch { display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 2px; margin-right: 6px; vertical-align: middle; }
  .edge-page .cols { display: grid; gap: 18px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin-top: 28px; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .edge-page .cols { grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr; } }
  .edge-page .cols section { margin-top: 0; min-width: 0; }
  .edge-page .paths { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.6em; display: grid; gap: 6px; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .edge-page .paths li { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .edge-page .paths .n { color: var(--text-muted); margin-left: 8px; }
  .edge-page .bars { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .edge-page .bars li { display: grid; gap: 3px; font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .edge-page .bars .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
  .edge-page .bars .n { font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--text-muted); }
  .edge-page .bars svg { width: 100%; height: 6px; display: block; }
  .edge-page .bars .track { fill: var(--bg-sunken); }
  .edge-page .bars .fill { fill: var(--accent); }
  .edge-page .contact-defenses[hidden] { display: none; }
  .edge-page .defenses { display: grid; gap: 16px; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin: 12px 0 0; }
  @media (min-width: 760px) { .edge-page .defenses { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
  .edge-page .defenses dt { font: 500 0.72rem var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .edge-page .defenses dd { margin: 2px 0 0; font: 700 1.4rem var(--mono); }
  .edge-page .defenses dd.why { margin: 4px 0 0; font: 0.8rem/1.4 var(--sans); color: var(--text-muted); }
  .edge-page .cols.two { margin-top: 18px; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .edge-page .cols.two { grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr; } }
  /* Categorical slots 1-4 (dataviz default dark steps), checked for colorblind separation on --bg-raised. */
  .edge-page .contact-trend .s1, .edge-page .swatch.s1 { fill: #3987e5; background: #3987e5; }
  .edge-page .contact-trend .s2, .edge-page .swatch.s2 { fill: #d95926; background: #d95926; }
  .edge-page .contact-trend .s3, .edge-page .swatch.s3 { fill: #199e70; background: #199e70; }
  .edge-page .contact-trend .s4, .edge-page .swatch.s4 { fill: #c98500; background: #c98500; }
  .edge-page .legend-row { flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .edge-page .empty { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .edge-page .how ul { margin: 0 0 10px; padding-left: 1.2em; display: grid; gap: 6px; }
  .edge-page code { font-family: var(--mono); background: var(--bg-sunken); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px; }
</style>
